# v03.0: Search tasks by title

Plan: [feature-search](../plans/feature-search.md)

Finding a task means reading the whole list, which stops working at the point
pagination bounds the list.

## Outcomes

- [ ] Outcome: a query matches against task titles
- [ ] Outcome: a query matching nothing returns an empty page

## Findings

- Search returns a page rather than a collection, so it inherits the response
  shape v02.0 settles.

> Test strategy: unit, query a match, a miss, and a partial word.
